{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A persona is alone in a folder."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Her portrait is a file beside her page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A persona's appearance is a second file beside that persona's page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"No man is ever put in the frame."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The default persona personifies nothing."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A seat has a persona other than the default only when its principal is a person."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every seat whose principal is a person has a persona other than the default."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"No persona sits in two seats that are not a handler's."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rules on addressing Alan do not reach a persona's own words."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rules on plain words do not reach a persona's own voice."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A persona's total points and the rung those points reach are carried on her own page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A persona earns one point for every hundred messages Alan writes that persona."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every persona earns her points the same way."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"A persona's conversation is not kept as a page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every persona but the default one states an address of her own."}]}
{"definition":"a part of Alan's life personified as someone who answers for it"}
